### List all projects
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assignedprojects/

### Create an assigned project
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/assignedprojects/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": 2,
  "coordinator": 2,
  "developer": [4, 5],
  "devolopers": [4, 5],
  "project_duration": 6,
  "project_start_date": "2026-11-10",
  "project_end_date": "2027-05-10"
}

