### Retrieve all tasks for a specific assigned project
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/585f7f3e-70ae-4163-aa14-2ffb45360a54/


### create a task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/585f7f3e-70ae-4163-aa14-2ffb45360a54/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigned_to": 7,
  "title": "Design the project dashboard",
  "description": "Create the initial dashboard layout.",
  "priority": "Medium"
}

